+declaration refuses (the `var` repair). -/
+def ofSchemaLocated : Representation → Read Ty
+  | .never a [] => do checkAnn [] a; .ok .never
+  | .unknown a [] => do checkAnn [] a; .ok .unknown
+  | .void a [] => do checkAnn [] a; .ok .unit
+  | .number a [c] => do
